      "content": "thanks for the advice. i'll try the magnesium and some ibuprofen. i'm just really worried about that heavy feeling though, it's been pretty constant today. since i'm really trying to avoid the hospital, do you think it's safe if i take a higher dose of ibuprofen than usual, like a double dose every few hours, just to make sure the inflammation doesn't get out of control? also is there any specific supplement like CoQ10 or anything that's known to specifically help with heart inflammation? i'm just trying to be proactive so i don't end up needing the ER.",
